      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So I have a untested theory on how to replicate this.\n\nI believe it's more likely to happen to fullbody users (unsure though if this also is likely to happen to halfbody users) who close SteamVR while in VRChat (either that or just simply closing VRChat) but either way, once that happens you see the affected user teleport about a meter or so before disappearing a few frames later.",
