      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yeah, thinking deeper on it, I believe it might just be related to SteamVR and people who have Playspace Mover / OVR Advanced Settings. It's likely just the user's playspace shifting in the frame before they disappear when shutting off SteamVR while in VRChat.",
