      "statusChangeID": "680f5d5f79f53b63e81e8a05",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Coming back to this issue, I've only been able to reproduce this problem when offsetting with OVR Advanced Settings and then exiting SteamVR (thanks very much for this suggestion!).\n\nI'm going to close this for now since I haven't been able to reproduce this in VRChat without using external software like OVR Advanced Settings, which is something we don't really have control over from our side.",
