  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Whenever a user leaves an instance, their avatar is quickly teleported in a random direction during the fade-out from their POV. This issue appears to be purely visual but is easily noticeable. \n\n**Steps to Reproduce:**  \n\n1. Observe another user's avatar as they leave an instance.  \n\n2. On your screen, their avatar will appear to teleport in a random direction during the moments as they leave.  \n\n3. On their end, they will not notice any unusual behavior, as the fadeout proceeds normally.\n\n**Additional Notes:**  \n\nThis issue is localized to observers and does not impact the departing user's experience. However, it does still create a visual anomaly albeit brief one for others.",
